Important architecture

There are two implementation levels:

Level 1 — Portal-assisted

Admin clicks:

OPEN eTIMS

and GELWO opens the official KRA portal.

After generating the required report/document, admin uploads it into GELWO and assigns it to a customer/order.

Level 2 — Authorized integration

If GELWO qualifies for and implements KRA's supported system-to-system integration, the GELWO backend can exchange the permitted information directly with eTIMS.

KRA specifically documents a system-to-system integration option, so we can design GELWO's architecture to accommodate it rather than hard-code a workaround.

