23. 🔐 ONE VERY IMPORTANT SECURITY RULE

For the government portals, GELWO should never store an admin's raw government password in the ordinary database.

Instead:

Portal links

Use official URLs.

Authorized integrations

Use official APIs/integration mechanisms where available.

Documents

Store copies/records inside GELWO with:

Encryption
Access controls
Audit logs
Version history
Document expiry
Who uploaded it
Who downloaded it
Who published it
Which customer can see it

This is particularly important because SHA's employer terms explicitly address credential confidentiality, employee-data consent and data protection obligations.

